## Heap Used Flags Feature (2026-01-19)

### Implementation Status
- **Task 4**: Added `ASTOptions.useHeapUsedFlags` flag
  - Each heap entry gets `(declare-const used_<class>_<index> Bool)`
  - Constraints are wrapped: `(=> used_X (invariant X))` instead of just `(invariant X)`
- **Task 5**: Monotonicity constraints added
  - `(assert (=> used_<class>_i+1 used_<class>_i))`
  - Ensures if entry i+1 is used, entry i must also be used
- **Task 6**: Upper limit constraint added
  - Based on `getComputedInstanceCount(className)` from strategy 1
  - `(assert (not used_<class>_k))` where k >= maxInstances
- **Task 7**: Minimize via Z3 optimize (NOT YET IMPLEMENTED)
  - Would use `(minimize (count_used))` or similar
  - Currently just uses upper bound constraint

### How to Enable
Set `ASTOptions.useHeapUsedFlags = true` before SMT generation.
Could add a command-line flag like `-use-heap-flags`.

